# Rolling Pumpkin: a cranky jack-o'-lantern that rolls along its lane.
# Its glowing grin sets it apart from the plain pumpkins in the patch off the field.
size 9 8 9
voxel 0.1
colors
  p pumpkin
  P pumpkinDark
  s stemGreen
  g glow
  k ink
box 1 0 1 7 6 7 p
box 0 1 1 8 5 7 p
box 1 1 0 7 5 8 p
box 2 0 8 2 6 8 P
box 6 0 8 6 6 8 P
box 0 1 4 0 5 4 P
box 8 1 4 8 5 4 P
box 4 7 4 4 7 4 s
# A big glowing toothy grin and narrowed eyes, so it reads as trouble.
box 2 4 0 3 4 0 g
box 5 4 0 6 4 0 g
box 2 5 0 2 5 0 k
box 6 5 0 6 5 0 k
box 1 2 0 7 2 0 g
box 2 1 0 6 1 0 g
box 3 2 0 3 2 0 P
box 5 2 0 5 2 0 P
